                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Rules in regard to belligerent vessels in French
                        ports.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">MINISTRY OF MARINE AND OF THE COLONIES.</p>
                <p>The minister of marine and of colonies to the maritime prefects; general
                    officers, superiors and others, commanding at sea; commandant of marine in
                    Algeria; governors of colonies; commissaries general of marine; chiefs of the
                    marine service in secondary ports; and administrators of the maritime
                    inscription.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
